        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-506 (ensure controlled execution — Kit Assembly, Build Execution &amp; Inventory Management (PA-92.2).) | - operational: ERP component consumption
Owner: Store Operations Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
