    <bpmn:process id="W_W3080" name="W3080. Build Capacity, Labor &amp; Throughput Planning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Build plan / capacity review
Frequency: Per build cycle + seasonal
Volume: DC build capacity vs. demand
Owner: DC Operations Manager
Participants: DC Ops, Supply Chain, HR/Labor Planning, Finance
Source: workflow W3080 — Build Capacity, Labor &amp; Throughput Planning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3080_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3080_Lane1" name="DC Ops">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3080_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3080_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3080_Lane2" name="Supply Chain">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3080_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3080_Lane3" name="HR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3080_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3080_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3080_Start5" name="Build plan / capacity review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3080_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3080_Task6" name="DC Ops forecasts build labor hours from build plan and standard times; balances…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: DC Ops forecasts build labor hours from build plan and standard times; balances against DC pick/ship labor capacity (links to W34/PA-19.3)
Responsible (R): DC Ops
Accountable (A): DC Operations Manager
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3080_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3080_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3080_Task7" name="Supply Chain/DC Ops sequence builds to smooth workload and avoid peak pick…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Supply Chain/DC Ops sequence builds to smooth workload and avoid peak pick contention; prioritize high-margin/high-velocity kits
Responsible (R): Supply Chain / DC Ops
Accountable (A): DC Operations Manager
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3080_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3080_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3080_Task8" name="HR/Labor Planning adjusts labor to build demand (seasonal ramp, overtime…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: HR/Labor Planning adjusts labor to build demand (seasonal ramp, overtime, temps); Finance monitors build labor cost vs. value
Responsible (R): HR / Finance
Accountable (A): DC Operations Manager
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3080_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3080_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3080_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3080_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3080_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-506 (ensure controlled execution — Kit Assembly, Build Execution &amp; Inventory Management (PA-92.2).) | - operational: sequencing and labor balancing
Owner: DC Operations Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
